    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58734" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κολυμβ-άς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">άδος</span>,
			ἡ, less 
			Att.
		 form of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κολυμβίς, κ. ἐλαία</span>
		olive <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>swimming</i>, i.e.
				<i>pickled in brine</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Diph.Siph.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				2.56b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
