				5.535.27
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Iamb.</u>
				1.273
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.609
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as
				Subst., </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			
				=
