			, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				9.395e
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> a shrub, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στοιβή</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				14.18
			</span></i>.</div>
